### GET jobs details
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs/details

### POST new customer
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pedro Lim",
    "phone": "0925-111-2222"
}

### POST invalid customer
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "phone": "0925"
}


### POST new job
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_id": 2,
    "device_model": "Xiaomi Redmi 12",
    "issue": "Broken speaker",
    "job_type": "Speaker Repair",
    "price": 450
}


### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CellHub Staff",
  "email": "staff@cellhub.com",
  "password": "staff12345"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@cellhub.com",
  "password": "staff12345"
}

### Check logged-in user
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Create job without token
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "device_model": "Samsung A15",
  "issue": "Broken screen",
  "job_type": "Screen Replacement",
  "price": 2500
}



### 1. Register (expect 201, no password shown)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ana Cruz","email":"ana@test.com","password":"secret123"}

### 2. Register again (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ana Cruz","email":"ana@test.com","password":"secret123"}

### 3. Login (expect 200 + token)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@test.com","password":"secret123"}

### 4. Wrong password (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@test.com","password":"wrongpass"}

### 5. Who am I, no token (expect 401 Please log in first)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### 6. Who am I, with token (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 7. Register Ben (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ben Lim","email":"ben@test.com","password":"secret123"}

### 8. Short password (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"X","email":"x@test.com","password":"123"}

### 9. Bad email (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"X","email":"abc","password":"secret123"}

### 10. NO token, add customer (expect 401 Please log in first)
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Pedro Lim","phone":"0925-111-2222"}

### 11. FAKE token, add customer (expect 401 invalid or expired)
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer abc

{"name":"Pedro Lim","phone":"0925-111-2222"}

### 12. GOOD token, add customer (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{"name":"Pedro Lim","phone":"0925-111-2222"}

### 13. NO token, add job (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id":2,"device_model":"Xiaomi Redmi 12","issue":"Broken speaker","job_type":"Speaker Repair","price":450}

### 14. NO token, update job (expect 401)
PUT http://localhost:3000/jobs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Completed"}

### 15. NO token, delete job (expect 401)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/jobs/1

### 16. NO token, delete customer (expect 401)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/customers/1

### 17. PUBLIC read, no token (expect 200 + list)
GET http://localhost:3000/customers


### 1. Good answer
GET http://localhost:3000/weather

### 2. Repeat (dapat cached: true)
GET http://localhost:3000/weather

### 3. Manila
GET http://localhost:3000/weather?city=Manila

### 4. City not found (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/weather?city=Nowhereville